    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.36.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqni abbootii isaanii waan saba isaa fi iddoo jireenya isaaf garaa laafeef karaa ergamoota isaatiin ammumaa amma ergaa itti erge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaan garuu ergamoota Waaqaatti qoosan; dubbii isaas tuffatanii raajota isaa xinneessan. Kanaanis dheekkamsi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.36.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saba isaatti ni buʼe; wanni isa qabbaneessus hin argamne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu inni mootii warra Baabilon isaanitti fide; mootichis mana qulqullummaa keessatti dargaggoota isaanii goraadeedhaan fixe; dargaggoota yookaan dubara, jaarsolii yookaan warra dullooman tokko illee hin hambifne. Waaqni hunda isaanii dabarsee harka Nebukadnezaritti kenne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis mana qulqullummaa Waaqaatii miʼoota hunda xinnaa fi guddaa, qabeenya mana qulqullummaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.36.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", qabeenya mootichaa fi kan qondaaltota isaa saamee Baabilonitti geesse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaan mana qulqullummaa Waaqaatti ibidda qabsiisanii dallaa Yerusaalem diigan; masaraawwan mootummaa hunda gubanii waan gatii qabu hundas barbadeessan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni hambaa goraadee irraa hafe boojiʼee Baabilonitti geesse; isaanis hamma mootummaan Faares aangoo qabatetti tajaajiltoota isaa fi tajaajiltoota ilmaan isaa taʼan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biyyattiin boqonnaa sanbata ishee ni argatte; akka dubbiin",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.36.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kan afaan Ermiyaasiin dubbatame raawwatamuuf hamma waggaan torbaatamni dhumutti biyyattiin yeroo ontee turte guutuu ni boqotte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
